OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifter stopped by police in
OL,4,Ariver jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shoplifter who was apprehended by a
OL,7,Fpolice officer in a river after he
OL,8,Fattempted to escape has been jailed for
OL,9,F24 weeks.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said Simon Child
OL,12,Ffled from officers after stealing
OL,13,Fsteaks from Marks and Spencer in
OL,14,FMansfield on 11 August.
OL,16,FHe was pursued by police as he ran
OL,17,Fthrough the River Maun under a bridge
OL,18,Fin the direction of Titchfield Park and
OL,19,Fwas eventually detained "after a brief
OL,20,Fstruggle", the force added.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
