OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifter stopped by police in
OL,4,Ariver jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FChild, 46 and of no fixed abode,
OL,7,Fadmitted theft and assaulting a police
OL,8,Fofficer, and was jailed following a
OL,9,Fhearing at Nottingham Magistrates'
OL,10,FCourt on Wednesday.
